From: RowanOS <rowanos@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Vulkan: validate KMS export layouts and SDR fallback formats
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [D16 vendor ICD scanout capabilities]

--- a/src/rendervulkan.cpp
+++ b/src/rendervulkan.cpp
